{"2961060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brutal Bible Bloodbaths", "steam_appid": 2961060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3081010, 4221720, 5016600], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal Bible Bloodbaths is a controversial first-person physics-based game. It involves a few sandbox levels that you can play around in. These levels include things mentioned in Bible passages, such as fruit trees that God says not to chop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cleanse the promised land</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on Deuteronomy 20:16-20 from the Bible, you have to kill everything that breathes and you can order soldiers to help you. Your victims include animals, children, babies, and sexual worship assistants. The Bible justifies this by explaining that God hates the way the people worship their gods.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The End Times</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a level it's the future and things have changed. The soldiers initially disobey your cleansing command and say &quot;Jesus will come and judge the world&quot;. They also quote Psalm 11:5 which says &quot;God hates people who love violence&quot;.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels based on other Bible passages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Elisha and the Bears (2 Kings 2:23-24)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a pair of bears, teach 42 wicked youths a lesson by mauling them all, but be careful not to kill anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>God the Grape Stomper (Isaiah 63:1-6)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As God, you stomp on metaphorical grapes that splatter on your clothes, representing the blood of your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wife Recruiter (Numbers 31:7, 17-18)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill everyone except for the virgin girls, whom you recruit to become wives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >With or without blood and gore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the initial warning screen you can choose whether you want blood and gore or not. This allows you to change the game mode to &quot;Unbrutal Bible Bubblebaths&quot; where bubbles appear during cleansing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fully dynamic chopping</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your magic laser sword, you can chop people, animals, and many other objects however you like, as much as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/8f9682d846a85d17619054a7ceb61630.poster.avif?t=1786412531\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/8f9682d846a85d17619054a7ceb61630.webm?t=1786412531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/8f9682d846a85d17619054a7ceb61630.mp4?t=1786412531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Precision chopping quest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An optional quest gets you to chop people and animals in specific ways such as chopping their leg, arm, or tail. When finished you can return to the box to see how obedient you were.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Sinful Temple</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a level you can explore a temple containing things God hates like child sacrifice and sexual worship assistants. You can worship the god/goddess idols in the temple but this will cause the soldiers to target you as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/2508285ee056f5173dee97663c7e45a0.avif?t=1786412531\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tidy up the bodies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level has you tidying up the clutter in the promised land after cleansing by pushing chopped up bodies into a pit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chase and chop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a level you have to chop people who are hiding and running for their lives and try to get a low enough cleansing time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Body Hacker</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This weapon allows you to hack the matrix in the game to make the targeted body part break into pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/3682bd7860384f4e36b2bdf75613e468.poster.avif?t=1786412531\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/3682bd7860384f4e36b2bdf75613e468.webm?t=1786412531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/3682bd7860384f4e36b2bdf75613e468.mp4?t=1786412531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Holy Hand Grenades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow all of the people and animals to kingdom come in slow motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/f37bab395ea0c9be260d96f8ce4a2454.poster.avif?t=1786412531\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/f37bab395ea0c9be260d96f8ce4a2454.webm?t=1786412531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/f37bab395ea0c9be260d96f8ce4a2454.mp4?t=1786412531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other things in the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also ride horses, get drunk on fermented fruit, build ladders to get over city walls, and chop just about everything including flowers and talking robots from the future.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal Bible Bloodbaths is a controversial first-person physics-based game. It involves a few sandbox levels that you can play around in. These levels include things mentioned in Bible passages, such as fruit trees that God says not to chop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cleanse the promised land</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on Deuteronomy 20:16-20 from the Bible, you have to kill everything that breathes and you can order soldiers to help you. Your victims include animals, children, babies, and sexual worship assistants. The Bible justifies this by explaining that God hates the way the people worship their gods.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The End Times</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a level it's the future and things have changed. The soldiers initially disobey your cleansing command and say &quot;Jesus will come and judge the world&quot;. They also quote Psalm 11:5 which says &quot;God hates people who love violence&quot;.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels based on other Bible passages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Elisha and the Bears (2 Kings 2:23-24)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a pair of bears, teach 42 wicked youths a lesson by mauling them all, but be careful not to kill anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>God the Grape Stomper (Isaiah 63:1-6)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As God, you stomp on metaphorical grapes that splatter on your clothes, representing the blood of your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wife Recruiter (Numbers 31:7, 17-18)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill everyone except for the virgin girls, whom you recruit to become wives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >With or without blood and gore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the initial warning screen you can choose whether you want blood and gore or not. This allows you to change the game mode to &quot;Unbrutal Bible Bubblebaths&quot; where bubbles appear during cleansing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fully dynamic chopping</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your magic laser sword, you can chop people, animals, and many other objects however you like, as much as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/8f9682d846a85d17619054a7ceb61630.poster.avif?t=1786412531\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/8f9682d846a85d17619054a7ceb61630.webm?t=1786412531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/8f9682d846a85d17619054a7ceb61630.mp4?t=1786412531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Precision chopping quest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An optional quest gets you to chop people and animals in specific ways such as chopping their leg, arm, or tail. When finished you can return to the box to see how obedient you were.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Sinful Temple</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a level you can explore a temple containing things God hates like child sacrifice and sexual worship assistants. You can worship the god/goddess idols in the temple but this will cause the soldiers to target you as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/2508285ee056f5173dee97663c7e45a0.avif?t=1786412531\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tidy up the bodies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level has you tidying up the clutter in the promised land after cleansing by pushing chopped up bodies into a pit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chase and chop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a level you have to chop people who are hiding and running for their lives and try to get a low enough cleansing time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Body Hacker</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This weapon allows you to hack the matrix in the game to make the targeted body part break into pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/3682bd7860384f4e36b2bdf75613e468.poster.avif?t=1786412531\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/3682bd7860384f4e36b2bdf75613e468.webm?t=1786412531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/3682bd7860384f4e36b2bdf75613e468.mp4?t=1786412531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Holy Hand Grenades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow all of the people and animals to kingdom come in slow motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/f37bab395ea0c9be260d96f8ce4a2454.poster.avif?t=1786412531\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/f37bab395ea0c9be260d96f8ce4a2454.webm?t=1786412531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/extras/f37bab395ea0c9be260d96f8ce4a2454.mp4?t=1786412531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other things in the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also ride horses, get drunk on fermented fruit, build ladders to get over city walls, and chop just about everything including flowers and talking robots from the future.</p>", "short_description": "Based on shocking Bible passages, use weapons like your magic laser sword to chop up everything that breathes in the promised land, causing blood to spray and splatter everywhere. You can also visit the future in the end of the world level.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/833d13e701210445358bccd638b2ada473c13e07/header.jpg?t=1786412531", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/8142d9944d80cc542a4adb9ad8c13cfcb9d6fcf7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786412531", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961060/8142d9944d80cc542a4adb9ad8c13cfcb9d6fcf7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786412531", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong